      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to the specification here http://developer.openstack.org/api-ref-identity-v3.html#createEndpoint, http API accepts \"region\" instead of \"region_id\", and I checked the code, which will create region if \"region\" is posted.\n\nOn one hand, I prefer to sticking to the spec because \"regoin_id\" is not documented, which will cause confusion, on the other hand, \"region_id\" is better because everywhere else uses it.\n\nWhat do you think?",
